{"type": "discussion_message", "day": 1, "phase": "day_discussion", "phase_label": "Day discussion", "speaker": "Player 5", "player": "Player 5", "action": "discussion", "private": false, "content": "Player 1, I have no night-time actions to explain — Night 1 only involved divination, with no attacks or wolf consults, so your accusation that I was \"not honest about night-time actions\" is baseless and I reject it outright. I agree with Player 2 and Player 3 that naming targets simply for being \"vocal\" is not evidence, and I find your pattern of making multiple accusations (against me, Player 2, Player 6) without a single concrete statement to point to quite suspicious. Player 4's Seer claim with Player 1 returning Human is the only CO on the table, and while I don't treat it as confirmed, it does give us a starting point; I'd note the odd phrasing of \"keeping the target name confidential\" right after naming Player 1, which I'll flag for later scrutiny. My plan for this turn: I want to hear from Players 6, 7, and 8, who haven't spoken yet, and I'd like Player 1 to name one specific statement or behavior they found suspicious rather than continuing to wave vaguely at \"strangeness.\" I am undecided on a vote target but my suspicion is currently leaning toward Player 1 for pattern-based manipulation, and I will not vote for anyone without at least one concrete inconsistency on the record.", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T14:34:03.236324+00:00", "game_id": "229098bbefe2", "sequence": 41}
